{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In this game, you control the strongest Kyojin and protect the weakest Chibito while exploring Hakoniwa.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Kyojin defeats enemies, and Chibito supports with her power of creation.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Carve a path using the powers of destruction and creation. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\u25aaThe Weapon of Calamity</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Kyojin can withstand enemy attacks and defeat them with overwhelming power.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">However, fighting at full power can neglect protecting Chibito.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Tactical judgment is needed to decide between attack and defense based on the situation. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Chibito is weak and unable to fight, so Kyojin protects her.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Sometimes Kyojin carries her, while other times they act separately.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Chibito uses her wisdom to guide Kyojin. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In this DEMO, you can play A part of\u00a0Ancient Ruins and\u00a0Coliseum.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3493160?t=1740997452","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3493160/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1740997452","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3493160/35c9f9f67658629278c04156ea17fbfd43303f28/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1740997452","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3493160/35c9f9f67658629278c0